  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Weaving peace</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project seeks to contribute to a lasting peace in Colombia and to the implementation of the Peace Agreement in terms of: i. mitigation and/or resolution of armed conflicts; ii. reduction of violence through dialogue initiatives and peace processes; and iii. inclusive peace processes with women&apos;s participation in all phases and peace agreements aligned with international standards, including victims&apos; rights and non-discrimination.</narrative>
  </description>
